":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T08:58:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041479","verified_at":"2026-10-25T11:30:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1847286114041477","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.96.2","summary":"Level select shows each difficulty's layoutSome levels change on Expert: a passage closes, a piece moves. The level preview nowshows the layout for the selected difficulty, so you can see what's different beforeyou start. Switching difficulty swaps the preview straight away.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T08:56:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041477","verified_at":"2026-10-25T11:30:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1847286114039647","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.96.1","summary":"Speedrun mode- New in Options > Speedrun: turn on the Speedrun Timer and race through the demo.- The timer only counts real play time. Loading, pausing, cutscenes and dialogue are left out, and the clock turns grey whenever it isn't counting.- See your total time and your time on the current level at all times, plus the version and difficulty you're playing in the top corner.- Playing on Chill or with a slower game speed? The timer shows an ASSIST tag, so assisted runs stay separate from regular","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T13:41:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039647","verified_at":"2026-10-24T13:52:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1847286114039502","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.96.0","summary":"A brand new campaign screen- Worlds, levels and difficulty now live together on one screen, instead of two separate menus.- Pick a difficulty and the whole screen takes its colour: green for Chill, blue for Normal, red for Expert. Your progress, best times and time limits update to match.- Level previews now show the real level, with its actual walls, blocks, spikes and even your current skin.- The full game's worlds appear after the demo, with a quick note that they're coming in Early Access an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039502","verified_at":"2026-10-24T13:52:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1847286114037009","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.95.22","summary":"feat: added a cool intro cutscene for the golem battle","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:04:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037009","verified_at":"2026-10-23T21:17:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1847286114035610","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Dimenshaper: Dev plays the demo live","summary":"Come hang out live during Steam Next Fest!I’m the developer of Dimenshaper, and this Saturday I’ll play through the demo live on this page.What to expect:A full run of the demo, including the toughest rooms and some speedrun attemptsA look at how the dimension switch works and how the levels are designedYour questions answered live in the chat: about the game, game dev, or GodotWhen: Saturday, 24 October · 19:00 CEST / 10:00 PDTAbout Dimenshaper Dimenshaper is a handcrafted precision platformer ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T09:20:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035610","verified_at":"2026-10-23T10:14:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1847286114031617","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.95.21","summary":"feat: added tutorial in first level with 3 dimensions for dimension controls","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:48:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031617","verified_at":"2026-10-22T12:46:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1846651706684705","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.95.20","summary":"We are getting ready for the Next Fest, so two main topics:New changes regarding inputs after some feedback - Dimension keys are now J / K / L (red / green / blue) - Same left-to-right order as the dimension icons in the HUD - Z / X / C work too, for players who move with the arrow keys - Controller buttons are unchanged - Custom key bindings are keptRegarding options menu...They are now available from the pause menu! So you can change your a11y or controls directly from there!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T14:25:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684705","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1846018067937996","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.95.19","summary":"- feat: add Assist options for Chill mode, starting with Game Speed (100%, 90%, 80%, 70%, 60%)- feat: add an Assist panel to the pause menu, shown only in Chill- feat: add Assist (Chill only) > Game Speed to Options > Accessibility- feat: mention in the Chill description where to find the assists","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T08:25:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937996","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1846018067936817","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.95.18","summary":"- feat: each colour now has its own button. LB/J picks green, RB/K picks blue, RT/LT or I/U picks red. This is the new default. Prefer the old way? Switch back in Options > Controls > Dimension Buttons: Cycle.- feat: the top of the screen shows which button picks each colour.- feat: tutorials and the rebinding screen now match whichever mode you use.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T17:11:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936817","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1846018067935903","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.95.17","summary":"Thanks to everyone who played the demo! The anonymous gameplay data you shared showed exactly where players were getting stuck, so this update smooths out the rough spots.Easier starts- 1-1: more room to land between the two spike pairs.- 1-4: a missed first mid-air jump is no longer instantly fatal.- 1-8: the moving platform starts close to you, so you no longer have to wait for it.Difficulty balancing- 1-15: most of the cannons now only appear in Expert. Normal and practice keep the two slow s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T10:28:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935903","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1844751498224443","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.95.16","summary":"feat: the level timer now waits for your first input by default, so you can read a new level before the clock startsfeat: levels that introduce dimension switching show the buttons that cycle it, one on each side of the colour iconsfeat: added a separate audio bus for effects with too much bassfeat: the boss arena's skill walls sit a row lower, changing how far each lava column runsfix: holding a direction while you die no longer drags the respawned player along with itfix: pausing now actually ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T12:57:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498224443","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1844751498221331","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.95.15","summary":"feat: the lava that lands a hit on the golem dries up, so you have to take him to the other side to hit him againfeat: boss fights now show a life bar frame instead of the timer framefix: the selected button is now the bright one instead of the dark one, in every menu and on the EULA screenfix: switches show a visible outline when selectedfix: slider handles brighten when selected instead of darkeningfix: the > marker now follows the option you are on instead of staying on the previous onefix: t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T12:25:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498221331","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1844115010497709","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.95.14","summary":"feat: added 4 more levels (challenge is served!)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T18:53:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010497709","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1844115010497330","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.95.13","summary":"feat: added better Golem fight mechanics feat: added localization for the 5 achievements","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T15:13:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010497330","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1844115010496846","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.95.12","summary":"feat: added three new achievements","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T08:56:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010496846","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1843481262705043","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.95.11","summary":"feat: added achievements logic (and two achievements to start with)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T16:12:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262705043","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1843481262703787","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.95.10","summary":"feat: added protomechanics for final boss battle","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T07:04:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262703787","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1843481262701903","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.95.9","summary":"fix: the up arrow and W only jump now and no longer confirm in the splash, world select, level select and level cards","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T14:49:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701903","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1843481262701417","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Dimenshaper Demo Is Now Available on macOS!","summary":"The Dimenshaper demo now officially supports macOS!If you’ve been waiting to try the game on your Mac, you can now download the demo directly from Steam and give it a go.As always, feedback is very welcome!Thanks for playing, and have fun shaping dimensions! 💚","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T11:29:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701417","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1843481262701282","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.95.8","summary":"feat: W and the up arrow now also jump, next to space, enter and the controller buttonfeat: new info box explaining how to switch dimensions on the first level where more than one dimension is available, demo level 6fix: wall gems are drawn above neighboring wall tilesfeat: the macOS export works","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T10:15:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701282","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1843481262695607","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.95.7","summary":"feat: added optional anonymous telemetry, asked once on first launch and switchable in Options > Datafeat: added a level failed event that records deaths and timeouts per level so hard spots can be found","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T15:12:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262695607","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5063870-1843481262695414","game_id":"steam-5063870","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.95.6","summary":"fix: resolution and window mode changes now ask for confirmation and revert after 10 seconds if not keptfix: resolution and window mode arrows no longer wrap around from the largest to the smallest optionfix: removed the 320x180 window size, which was too small to read or navigatefix: resolution arrows are greyed out while fullscreen is active instead of changing the label without effectfix: hid the resolution, window mode and VSync options on Steam Deck, where the system controls themfeat: adde","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T14:10:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstor